# Prettier is scoped to the TypeScript sources under packages/ and the build scripts, via the
# globs in package.json's format/format:check. It deliberately does NOT cover the repo's existing
# markdown (docs/, README.md, .claude/) or the bash-era config: running it over those reformats ~60
# hand-written files that nothing here is changing, which buries a real diff in whitespace churn.
# Bringing those under prettier is a separate, deliberate pass.
#
# This file covers the paths that must stay untouched even if a glob is ever widened.

# Generated single-file executables. Built by scripts/build-cli.mjs, committed on purpose.
bin/
dist/
node_modules/
.yarn/
.nx/
CHANGELOG.md
yarn.lock
docs/
